{"synopsis":"Erkin, seorang apoteker muda asal utara, menjadi yatim piatu akibat perang antara Bangsa-Bangsa Utara dan Mormeratta. Setelah berhasil menorehkan namanya di Mormeratta, ia dipanggil untuk merawat seorang “tuan kastil” misterius yang belum pernah dilihat oleh siapa pun. Dengan enggan ia menyetujuinya, berharap hal itu akan membawanya selangkah lebih dekat untuk menemukan Penyihir Matahari yang terkenal kejam, yang telah membunuh orang tuanya selama perang. Tanpa ia sadari, dalam perjalanannya mencari balas dendam, sang penyihir mungkin telah berada di sisinya sepanjang waktu. Apa yang akan dilakukan Erkin ketika berhadapan dengan musuh bebuyutannya yang kini menjadi temannya?","alternative_title":"저무는 해, 시린 눈","author":"MURO","artist":"MURO","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"301d80f9-2fbf-43ee-a054-8da986fb0ebe","number":"229","chapter":"229","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"6f9904f5-f59c-4296-aa75-6fad627615ea","number":"228","chapter":"228","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"a56f06e0-3574-4f5f-bf01-144497878d5a","number":"227","chapter":"227","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"01345af8-c408-4c93-a36f-cc1789737d91","number":"226","chapter":"226","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"69bb53a9-fad6-4889-9055-b567619796e1","number":"225","chapter":"225","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"86d95b75-c536-473a-9e83-b6be7e4dc452","number":"224","chapter":"224","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"a6562990-09f3-4e5c-adad-8137dccff7f3","number":"223","chapter":"223","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"27391792-77b1-4657-b5c1-47511d008431","number":"222","chapter":"222","title":"","date":"2026-06-23","released":"2026-06-23"},{"chapter_id":"c5773883-ce61-40f4-89a2-6fd8962a1032","number":"221","chapter":"221","title":"","date":"2